# The Alliance mage robe at 15: Report to Jennea (1919), Investigate the Blue
# Recluse (1920), Gathering Materials (1921) and Manaweave Robe (1941).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# the coffers and the Rift Spawn in the Blue Recluse, and the Miners' League
# Crates in Loch Modan; Forever's Mage class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) and quest data
# (quests 1920 and 1941, checked 2026-10-14) for
# the races and the reward (Manaweave Robe); the quest texts for the Blue
# Recluse and the Silver Stream Mine; data/local/mechanics (quest-steps and
# quest-notes, checked 2026-10-20) for the stun-and-capture, the cantation's
# 5 minute cooldown and how many spawns each room brings, the Rift Spawns'
# level, the table's 5 minute respawn, and the 14 crates (3-5 minute respawn).
# Forever's quest data lists Human, Gnome and Skyborne mages for 1919-1921;
# corrections.json adds Skyborne to 1919 and 1921, which the merged data
# gave to Humans and Gnomes only. Manaweave Robe (1941) is Human and Gnome in
# quests.json, but Forever's quest page for 1941 names Skyborne too (check.py
# quest 1941: races page=Human/Gnome/HighOrderSkyborne), so the guide offers it
# to all three (corrections-private sets it).
# Investigate the Blue Recluse needs Report to Jennea first (quests.json):
# Zaldimar Wefhellt in Goldshire, Magis Sparkmantle in Kharanos and Dink in
# Ironforge give it.
# Not in a leveling guide: the Charged Rift Gems are only in Loch Modan, which
# no Alliance route visits at this level.

step Zaldimar Wefhellt (Goldshire)
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Zaldimar Wefhellt is the Goldshire mage trainer, upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn.
  level 15
  accept 1919 npc 328                         -- Zaldimar Wefhellt

step Dink (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip Dink teaches mages in Ironforge's Mystic Ward. Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind afterwards.
  level 15
  accept 1919 npc 7312                        -- Dink

step Jennea Cannon
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Jennea Cannon stands at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum, the violet tower of the Mage Quarter: climb the spiral ramp and take the portal near the top. The Chest of Containment Coffers and the Cantation of Manifestation lie on the table behind her (both come back 5 minutes after someone takes them). You hand both in at the end, so keep them.
  turnin 1919                                 -- Jennea Cannon
  accept 1920
  collect 7247 quest 1920.2                   -- Chest of Containment Coffers
  collect 7308 quest 1920.3                   -- Cantation of Manifestation

step The Blue Recluse
  tip The Blue Recluse is the tavern in the Mage Quarter. Read the Cantation of Manifestation inside to make the invisible Rift Spawns (level 16-17) show: in the basement it brings out one, on the balcony or in the kitchen two, in the main room or by the door three, so read it downstairs. They hit hard and break out of Frost Nova fast. Beat one down: it does not die but sits stunned with a spiral over its head; use the Chest of Containment Coffers on it while it is stunned, then click the Filled Containment Coffer it leaves on the floor (clicking before it appears wastes a charge). You need three, and the cantation works only once every 5 minutes (logging out does not reset it), so plan on three rounds.
  use 7308 optional @51.3,93.3 live           -- Cantation of Manifestation
  kill 6492 optional                          -- Rift Spawn, down to the stun
  use 7247 optional @51.3,93.3 live           -- Chest of Containment Coffers, on the stunned Rift Spawn
  collect 7292 x3 quest 1920.1 @51.3,93.3 live -- Filled Containment Coffer

step Back to Jennea Cannon
  turnin 1920                                 -- Jennea Cannon
  accept 1921

step Linen Cloth
  tip Any humanoid drops Linen Cloth, and the Tunnel Rats in the Silver Stream Mine drop it while you gather the gems; the Auction House in the Trade District sells it. You hand in ten.
  collect 2589 x10 quest 1921.1 @61.2,71.3 map 1453 live -- Linen Cloth: humanoids, or the Auction House

step The Silver Stream Mine
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge, then the road east through the South Gate tunnel into Loch Modan. The Silver Stream Mine is at the north end of the loch, north of Thelsamar; Tunnel Rat kobolds hold it. The gems come only from the tall stacked Miners' League Crates (the cursor shows a cog over them; single boxes hold nothing): every crate gives one, there are fourteen and they come back after 3 to 5 minutes. You may have to go as deep as the end chamber for six. The same crates serve the dwarves' Filthy Paws quest.
  collect 7249 x6 quest 1921.2                -- Charged Rift Gem: Miners' League Crates

step Wynne Larson
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Back to Stormwind by the tram. Wynne Larson works at Larson Clothiers in the Mage Quarter.
  turnin 1921                                 -- Wynne Larson
  accept 1941
  turnin 1941                                 -- Wynne Larson: Manaweave Robe
